The last two by Qwen-Image 2.1 (off when it is not here), kept in this browser; the run goes to 2.1 without the form's model, sampling, adapters, mask, canvas or extra noise; the run's line says which; Again asks the same. Seven strings in the eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
